# Lesson 1 (Switch Lanes) on a phone: a tap on the tray's Move left before the first kiosk, then a swipe to the
# right on the street back to the centre lane, which completes the lesson's two lane changes; then the results.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 300 Metro Dash
frames 150
save title
touch =Learn
until 60 single rule
frames 10
touch =Lesson 1: Switch Lanes
until 60 Expected
frames 10
save briefing
touch =Start
until 120 GO
frames 40
save run
touch =Move left
frames 120
save left-lane
swipe 50% 60% 85% 60% 3
until 120 Stage Complete
frames 20
save results
expect First Arrival
touch =Menu
until 60 How to Play
frames 10
